ed.","refs":[{"id":"shell/plugins/menu/Menu.qml","kind":"file","line":287},{"id":"test/shell.d/menu-startup-route-test.sh","kind":"file","line":1},{"id":"proof/known-issues/KI-MENU-PENDING-INITIAL-MENU-DEAD.yaml","kind":"file","line":1}],"severity":"info","title":"Mirror composition: upstream change vs proof work","verification":{"evidence":[],"method":"untyped finding","note":"No typed claim: this finding is the author's judgement and is not checked against the package.","status":"unverifiable"}}],"packageDigest":"sha256:9cb3c42ec3ed3a761018f600a516685aa0d60185d516f918b5a53dfb4c2e5858","packageIdentity":"epkg-714dda742acd86e98a8a27fb1a35a8604b707b39ca3d9e04076782da15eb4c68","riskAssessment":{"level":"medium","rationale":"A small change confined to the pending-route path, reusing openRoute, pinned by a 27-check test and a behaviour comparison whose 5 differences are all classified intended with identical controls. Medium, not low, because 5 prevents_ready disclosures remain (the unapproved compat findings), Menu.qml has no engine-measured code MC/DC, and the FileView.loaded model is not driven through a live shell in this package. Not merge approval."},"schemaVersion":"reqproof.review-annotation.v1","suggestedTests":[{"forClaim":12,"rationale":"Settles the FileView.loaded model the gate relies on, through real IPC in a running shell.","refs":[{"id":"shell/plugins/menu/Menu.qml","kind":"file","line":298},{"id":"test/shell.d/menu-acceptance-test.sh","kind":"file"}],"title":"Live cold start with a delayed or missing user extension"},{"forClaim":13,"rationale":"Pins the stated residual so a maintainer can keep or narrow it.","refs":[{"id":"shell/plugins/menu/Menu.qml","kind":"file","line":287}],"title":"Cursor move on root before the user file answers"}],"summary":"**What the PR does.** omacom/omarchy#14055 (head 48405669, two commits) fixes #14053: a menu route summoned while the shell starts opened root and stayed there. 43d787d4 keeps a route that fell back to root pending and opens it from rebuildItemsFromSources; 48405669 (after review) waits until the default file has loaded and the user file has loaded or failed, tries the route once, and drops it when the user types or opens another menu. The rest of the mirror is proof work (SW-REQ-261002-DK0D, reviews, the fixed known issue, harness ops and inputs).\n\n**Is the fix verified?** The audit run is clean (0 errors, 0 warnings). Test results are ingested and current: 56/56 passed; all 29 changed requirements are observed_pass; 30 obligation cells observed_pass, 15 not_linked. The PR's test passes 27/27 at the head (re-run by the reviewer). The behaviour-comparison harness and its 12 startup inputs have observed outcomes (13 passed). Code-level MC/DC does not cover Menu.qml, so diffCoverage measures 0 changed decisions.\n\n**Compatibility.** All four compat sources ran. 5 unapproved findings (prevents_ready), all differential and classified intended against DK0D: a startup route opens instead of root (both files at once, in either order, and with a later reload), and a startup action alias runs once. Controls (only the default file loaded, typing or navigating first, a summon after startup) are identical. test_diff, mcdc_diff and removed_behavior report none.\n\n**Questions for a human.** Approve or reject each compat finding. Does FileView.loaded behave as modelled in a live shell (not run live here)? Should a cursor move on root also drop the route?\n\n**Traceability.** Every in-scope changed file maps to a requirement (15/15). No spec-gap candidates.\n\n**Not caused by this PR.** coverage_unmeasured (the .events inputs are data), changed_files_out_of_scope, checks_skipped (13 by configuration) and effects_unavailable (QML) inform only.\n\n**Readiness** is not_assessed; next decision human_judgement (compat_changes_unapproved, 5 changes), reviewer authority. Nothing here is an approval."}
